SSTP mode (sstp.go) is Ghajar's own implementation of [MS-SSTP], RFC 1661,
1332, 1877, 1334, 2759 and 3079 (verified against the RFC 2759 / RFC 3079
test vectors in helper_test.go). The Open-SSTP-Client project
(github.com/kittoku/Open-SSTP-Client, 5f97511, MIT, (c) 2019 KOBAYASHI
Ittoku) was read as a reference for the message layouts; no code from it is
included. MD4 comes from golang.org/x/crypto/md4 (BSD-3-Clause).
